{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31919","headline":"再投李益常侍 · 贾岛","name":"再投李益常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处初投刺，当时赴尹京。\n淹留花柳变，然诺肺肠倾。\n避暑蝉移树，高眠雁过城。\n人家嵩岳色，公府洛河声。\n联句逢秋尽，尝茶见月生。\n新衣裁白苎，思从曲江行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}